[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
postfix-dane-policy needs a local DNSSEC-validating resolver and trusts its
AD bit. The base system's local_unbound fits the defaults (127.0.0.1):

  sysrc local_unbound_enable=YES
  service local_unbound start

Enable the service:

  sysrc postfix_dane_policy_enable=YES
  service postfix_dane_policy start

Other addresses (e.g. Unbound from ports in a jail) go into
postfix_dane_policy_args, see postfix-dane-policy(8).

Then put it first in main.cf, before an MTA-STS resolver if you use one:

  smtp_tls_security_level = verify
  smtp_dns_support_level = dnssec
  smtp_tls_policy_maps =
      socketmap:inet:127.0.0.1:8462:dane,
      socketmap:inet:127.0.0.1:8461:mta-sts

Note: "verify" as the global level defers mail to servers without a
valid CA certificate or without STARTTLS.
EOM
}
]
